      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, i'll try to keep track of it. do you think the fact that it stops when i sit down means it's definitely just acid related? i'm just worried it's something more serious and i'm wasting time on Tums if it's actually my heart. but it really just feels like a burning sting, you know?",
